---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "$49 New Patient Dental Special in Tempe, AZ"
description: "New to 3rd Set Smiles? See what's included in our $49 new-patient dental offer for patients without insurance and book your visit online in Tempe."
permalink: /special-offers/
breadcrumb:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Special Offers", url: "/special-offers/" }
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span>Special Offers</div>
    <h1>$49 New Patient Dental <span>Special in Tempe</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">New to 3rd Set Smiles and without insurance? Get a comprehensive exam, digital X-rays &amp; a cleaning for just $49 — request your visit below and we'll confirm within one business day.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="offer-band" aria-labelledby="offer-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="offer-inner">
      <div class="offer-body">
        <div class="section-label" style="color:var(--gold-light)">New to 3rd Set Smiles?</div>
        <h2 id="offer-heading">No dental insurance? Start with our <span>$49</span> new-patient visit.</h2>
        <ul class="offer-list">
          <li>Comprehensive exam</li>
          <li>Full-mouth digital X-rays</li>
          <li>Healthy-mouth cleaning</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="offer-fine">For new patients without insurance. Excludes deep (periodontal) cleanings or treatment-related X-rays. Cannot be combined with insurance benefits. Subject to change without notice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="offer-cta">
        <div class="offer-price"><span class="offer-price-num">$49</span><span class="offer-price-label">Exam, X-rays &amp; cleaning</span></div>
        <a href="/book/?appointmentType=new-patient&amp;source=new-patient-offer" class="btn-primary" data-action="new-patient-offer-booking">Book Your $49 New Patient Visit</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section contact-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-wrap">

      <div class="contact-info">
        <div class="fade-in">
          <h2>What your $49 visit includes</h2>
          <p>A relaxed, no-pressure first visit with Dr. Phillips — time to understand your mouth and your goals before anything else.</p>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Comprehensive exam, including an oral-cancer screening</li>
            <li>Full-mouth digital X-rays</li>
            <li>A healthy-mouth cleaning</li>
            <li>A written summary and honest options — no pressure to commit</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-in">
          <div class="section-label" style="color:var(--gold-light);margin-top:8px">Also available to new patients</div>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li><strong>Free implant consultation</strong> — single-tooth or <a href="/services/all-on-4/">full-arch</a>, with a written treatment plan and transparent pricing.</li>
            <li><strong>Whitening with your cleaning</strong> — custom take-home trays at a reduced rate.</li>
            <li><strong>Veteran &amp; uninsured discounts</strong> — we're a veteran-owned practice and glad to help.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-in">
          <div class="contact-detail">
            <div class="contact-detail-label">Prefer to book by phone?</div>
            <div class="contact-detail-value"><a href="tel:{{ site.phone.telShort }}" data-action="call-offer">{{ site.phone.display }}</a></div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-detail">
            <div class="contact-detail-label">Hours</div>
            <div class="contact-detail-value">
              {{ site.hours.display }}<br>
              <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55)">{{ site.hours.weekend }}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {# Anchor target for the offer-band CTA — lands directly on the form card,
         with scroll-margin to clear the fixed top banner (var(--banner-h)) + nav (72px). #}
      <div class="contact-form-wrap fade-in" id="request" style="scroll-margin-top:calc(92px + var(--banner-h))">
        {% set formId = "offer" %}
        {% set formHeading = "Claim your $49 new-patient visit" %}
        {% set formIntro = "New patient without insurance? Send your details and we'll confirm your $49 exam, X-rays & cleaning within one business day." %}
        {% set formReason = "New patient exam & cleaning" %}
        {% include "partials/contact-form.njk" %}
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container-narrow prose">
    <p class="muted" style="text-align:center">Offers cannot be combined with insurance benefits unless noted. New patients only where indicated. The $49 special excludes deep (periodontal) cleanings and treatment-related X-rays. Subject to change without notice.</p>
  </div>
</section>
